{"3188530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Golfie Up!", "steam_appid": 3188530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Golfie Up! </strong>is a precision platformer that rolls you to the edge of glory and the brink of madness! Jump, roll, and master the art of momentum in a world where every slip could send you tumbling back down. Play solo or with up to 8 friends, collect hidden treasures, and test your skills in heart-racing speedruns. Just remember: falling is part of the game—but the climb is always worth it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the spirit of <i>Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy</i> and <i>Chained Together</i>, this game tests your skills, patience, and possibly also friendships!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In a nutshell:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficult roll-a-ball-y platforming with nuanced jump and recovery mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use fun power-ups to boost, fly, teleport, or even explode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will fall, and you will lose progress, but it’s never unfair! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather collectibles in hidden- or extra challenging places!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring a friend on the journey for a co-op experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try speedrunning to get on the leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From momentum-based challenges to anxiety-inducing jumps, there is much fun (and pain) to be had in this game!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Golfie Up! </strong>is a precision platformer that rolls you to the edge of glory and the brink of madness! Jump, roll, and master the art of momentum in a world where every slip could send you tumbling back down. Play solo or with up to 8 friends, collect hidden treasures, and test your skills in heart-racing speedruns. Just remember: falling is part of the game—but the climb is always worth it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the spirit of <i>Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy</i> and <i>Chained Together</i>, this game tests your skills, patience, and possibly also friendships!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In a nutshell:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficult roll-a-ball-y platforming with nuanced jump and recovery mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use fun power-ups to boost, fly, teleport, or even explode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will fall, and you will lose progress, but it’s never unfair! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather collectibles in hidden- or extra challenging places!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring a friend on the journey for a co-op experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try speedrunning to get on the leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From momentum-based challenges to anxiety-inducing jumps, there is much fun (and pain) to be had in this game!</p>", "short_description": "A difficult precision platformer for 1-8 players where you jump and roll to the top of the world! Master the nuanced mechanics to make your way across the challenging environments filled with secrets. Try not to fall, cause there’s a long way back up!", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Danish, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188530/header.jpg?t=1739369764", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188530/82c91114f83d7229d5ae705f0e5ec944ff055acb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739369764"